note Finds the old slice by hash (the match nearest the step's last place when the text repeats), cuts it out with three lines of context, and aligns it with every target, keeping the alignment that keeps the most lines, nearest the old place on a tie. Refuses (LeftStale) when no symbol of that name is left anywhere or under half the lines survive: those need someone to read the code. Prints the follow report: old range, new range, moved file, lines kept.

