note Stale until proven current. Several symbols in one file can share a name; the one whose text still hashes right wins, else the first whose offsets fit in the file, so a step on StepChange::tag does not land on Author::tag and a re-pin is needed only when the text itself changed. A resolved but changed slice keeps its lines so the reader sees where it was; a gone file or symbol leaves the previous lines untouched.

